From f9f29007933c1d4dea3a6da7f04d5ef6be6983ea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Perrin <44126061+AlexPerrin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 09:00:33 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Hunter: guild hunter and Verity dialogues for Hunters'
 Rumours, jerboas

The Burrow's guild hunters (Gilman, Cervus, Ornus, Aco, Teco, Wolf) and
Guild Scribe Verity from the wiki transcripts: Talk-to and the Rumour op
assign, remind, switch to and hand in rumours (turn-in lines such as
"Here's your reward." and "Another one done?", which RuneLite's Hunter
Rumours plugin tracks), Verity unlocks rumours, reports the completed count
and toggles back-to-back rumours (the rumour last handed in is not offered
again while off). Gilman sells Trapper's Tipple and stew. The carnivorous
chinchompa rumour is named "red chinchompa", as in OSRS. Embertailed
jerboas are caught in box traps (39, 137 XP, jerboa tail, the wiki's
"...or maybe not." message) and are a rumour for Gilman and Ornus.
